    "title": {
     "label": "Improve Features for US Stocks"
    },
    "content": {
     "label": "You guys are doing an amazing job. The app feels incredibly smooth, intuitive, and easy to use. I really appreciate the simplicity and overall user experience.\n\nHowever, I would like to suggest a few improvements to the US stocks section. It would be great to have more detailed company information, similar to what is available for Indian stocks, including financials, company fundamentals, and other key business details.\n\nAdditionally, please consider introducing a Save to Watchlist feature for US stocks, just like the one available for Indian stocks.\n\nThese additions would make the US stock investing experience much more comprehensive and convenient. Keep up the great work!",
     "attributes": {
      "type": "text"
